```jsonc
// ~/.dsh/profiles/<profile>/package.json
{
  "dependencies": { "dsh-skill-triage": "link:C:/Users/<you>/.dsh/plugins/dsh-skill-triage" },
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": [ /* 原有项 */, "dsh-skill-triage" ] } }

再确保 `~/.dsh/profiles/<profile>/node_modules/dsh-skill-triage` 指向插件目录。

